{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>About the Demo</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Anomaly Runner demo introduces you to the game's beginning and the first anomaly area. Explore a mysterious environment, encounter 16 unique anomalies, and use your wits to find a way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>About Anomaly Runner</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Uncover the Unknown in Anomaly Runner</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a member of the Anomalies Detection Team, your mission is to investigate and contain mysterious anomalies across various high-risk areas. Face bizarre and unpredictable phenomena, uncover the hidden truth behind the ARC organization, and fight to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0Immerse yourself in a unique sci-fi world filled with mystery and danger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0Explore <strong>80+ anomalies</strong> across <strong>five distinct anomaly areas</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0Unravel the gripping story of the ARC and its dark secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0Use your intelligence and keen observation skills to find a way out.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you survive the unknown and uncover the truth?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3633980?t=1744705946","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633980/75092ccf8e49c2db8de484f8de8b34b4325408c2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744705946","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633980/feba90ec4476f6fb460dcf121a9bea321ee39829/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744705946","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633980/feba90ec4476f6fb460dcf121a9bea321ee39829/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744705946","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>About the Demo</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Anomaly Runner demo introduces you to the game's beginning and the first anomaly area. Explore a mysterious environment, encounter 16 unique anomalies, and use your wits to find a way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>About Anomaly Runner</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Uncover the Unknown in Anomaly Runner</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a member of the Anomalies Detection Team, your mission is to investigate and contain mysterious anomalies across various high-risk areas. Face bizarre and unpredictable phenomena, uncover the hidden truth behind the ARC organization, and fight to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0Immerse yourself in a unique sci-fi world filled with mystery and danger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0Explore <strong>80+ anomalies</strong> across <strong>five distinct anomaly areas</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0Unravel the gripping story of the ARC and its dark secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0Use your intelligence and keen observation skills to find a way out.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you survive the unknown and uncover the truth?</p>","developers":["Igor Maliukh"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3617370","name":"Anomaly Runner"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633980/ac801b772f818e583359de79a70053d27e